1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
China's spiciest pot was born on the docks.
中国最辣的锅，生在码头

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,300
Chongqing hotpot — from Qing-era boatmen.
重庆火锅，源自清代船工

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,700
They boiled cheap offal in chili and beef tallow.
廉价内脏，辣椒牛油一锅煮

5
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:11,100
Strangers shared one pot, so they split it.
拼桌一锅，于是隔成格

6
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,500
That's the nine-grid — one square each.
这就是九宫格，一人一格

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,900
The soul of it? Málà.
它的灵魂，是"麻辣"

8
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:18,300
Sichuan pepper numbs; chili burns.
花椒让你麻，辣椒让你辣

9
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,700
巴适! Double-tap if your mouth is watering.
巴适！流口水的，点个赞

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,500
★ Expert Tip: New to málà? Ask for a 鸳鸯 twin pot — mild broth on one side.
内行提示：怕辣就点鸳鸯锅，一半清汤

11
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,400
Twin-pot mild or the full red — which side is yours?
你选鸳鸯清汤，还是全红？
